{"id":"c189b9b31702b9de","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-rel-image.md","title":"ZFC Rel Image","display":"df-zfc-rel-image — ZFC Rel Image","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-image","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-image"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-image — ZFC Rel Image","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-rel-range]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-image"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-image — ZFC Rel Image"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" href=\"?note=9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-range\">58-df-zfc-rel-range</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A,B\\in V\">\\(R,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S(B,R,A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(Y,R)\\land B=\\{y\\in Y\\mid\\exists x\\in A\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S(B,R,A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(Y,R)\\land B=\\{y\\in Y\\mid\\exists x\\in A\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical range predicate both verifies that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is a relation and supplies the set bound for the image comprehension.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-range","status":"resolved","id":"9a8f01bfcbcdc014","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-range]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S(B,R,A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(Y,R)\\land B=\\{y\\in Y\\mid\\exists x\\in A\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":753,"backlinks":[{"id":"31e075a848427dc9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b087834bf20eac60","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f341fbb666f74df3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f[F]$ (image operation, see [[58-df-zfc-rel-image]])"},{"id":"102ae3001d5e421b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"484e951b19c4c192","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S$（关系像谓词，见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-rel-image.md]]）"},{"id":"9898f784280180b2","anchor":"ref